{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(11月12日)天氣預測，大致多雲。日間部分時間有陽光及乾燥，最高氣溫約27度。吹和緩東至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁。</p>\n<p>展望明日稍後至星期六初時有驟雨，星期六稍後及星期日短暫時間有陽光。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:26:02.408048+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:03:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:30.182722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:30.182722+00:00","content_hash":"b6975f875b6a12ee3d854d70a7290ae53abde024eb0fb0311a91431ffb2ea22c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}